# CR 107.3b, 118.9: X must be zero for an energy cast. At zero energy that alternative disappears, but normal casting remains legal.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Show and Tell
Primal Prayers
Walking Ballista
Walking Ballista
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Lightning Bolt x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Show and Tell.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Primal Prayers)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Walking Ballista.Cast(X: 2; Ability: Pay {E})
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Energy = 1
Bot1.Hand.Walking Ballista.Cast(X: 1; Ability: Pay {E})
